# T93 lyrics (plan 2026-10-25-m3-library.md, I193, F19). tests/net/lyrics.cmake runs this from tests/m3 with --db
# against the devilbox fixture; the songs and their lyrics sit in tests/m3/lyrics/.
#   ambient.mod + ambient.lrc  local file: lyric_source=lrc, at 12.5 s the line is index 3 (the 00:12.00 line)
#   message.it                 tracker song message, plain text: lyric_source=message
#   techno.mod                 no local lyrics: the fixture endpoint answers, lyric_source=devilbox, synced
#   nogenre.mod                the fixture answers 503 (a 404 is "unknown md5", not missing): devilbox_missing=lyrics, lyric_source=none
# lyric_fetches counts endpoint requests (cumulative): ambient.lrc asks once for the upload decision (I193b), message.it never.
# library.lyrics_online is left at its default ("on"), so this script also proves the default.
OPEN lyrics/ambient.mod
SEEK 12500
@render 441
@lyrics
OPEN lyrics/message.it
@render 441
@lyrics
OPEN lyrics/techno.mod
@render 441
@lyrics
SEEK 2600
@render 441
@lyrics
OPEN lyrics/nogenre.mod
@render 441
@lyrics
